This repo is Jen Archuleta's LIVE website. Anything merged into `main` goes live on
jenarchuleta.com within minutes.

Before changing anything, read `AGENTS.md` (the rules that must never break) and
`CLAUDE.md` (the full rulebook) at the repo root, and follow them. Work on a branch,
open a pull request, and never push straight to `main`.
